        "title": "MagSafe Monday: BLAVOR’s solar power bank is built for fall camping trips",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/bllavors-solar-power-bank-is-built-for-fall-camping-trips/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/solar-batter.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The weather is turning cooler, and it’s time for camping and football tailgates. BLAVOR’s 20000mAh Solar Power Bank is built for this time of year. It has four built-in cables so you can leave your bag at home, a solar panel for recharging, and a wireless pad on top for your iPhone and Apple Watch. Let’s take a look at it.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"magsafe-monday\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1067362\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/bllavors-solar-power-bank-is-built-for-fall-camping-trips/#more-1067362\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
