        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/apple-watch-series-12-and-ultra-4-introduce-a-new-theater-mode-setting/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-watch-series-12-heart-health-sensing.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4 include a new Health Sensing System that dramatically improves heart rate data. The new system also includes a new Theater Mode setting that you may want to enable.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-watch,apple-watch-series-12,apple-watch-ultra-4\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070801\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/apple-watch-series-12-and-ultra-4-introduce-a-new-theater-mode-setting/#more-1070801\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
