        "title": "New all-glass iPhone 20 Pro rumor reveals another design change",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/iphone-20-pro-could-be-apples-biggest-pro-phones-yet/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/iphone-19-pro-20-anniversary-max.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s major 20th-anniversary iPhone refresh is in the works for next year. A new rumor today reiterates expectations that the iPhone 20 Pro and iPhone 20 Pro Max will have even bigger screens than the current models.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070729\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/iphone-20-pro-could-be-apples-biggest-pro-phones-yet/#more-1070729\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
