        "title": "You can now claim your payout from Apple’s $250 million Siri settlement",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/you-can-now-claim-your-payout-from-apples-250-million-siri-settlement/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/04/apple-intelligence-rainbow.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/24/apples-250-million-siri-settlement-just-got-approved-heres-who-gets-paid/\">major class action lawsuit</a> against Apple over Siri and Apple Intelligence delays continues to progress. Apple is expected to pay $250 million to settle the lawsuit, and you can now submit your claim to get a chunk of that payout. Here’s how.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,apple-intelligence\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070712\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/you-can-now-claim-your-payout-from-apples-250-million-siri-settlement/#more-1070712\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
