        "title": "iFixit tears down iPhone 18 Pro, explores variable aperture, finds concerning repair issue",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/20/ifixit-tears-down-iphone-18-pro-explores-variable-aperture-finds-concerning-repair-issue/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/ifixit-18-pro-teardown.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iFixit has published its traditional teardown of the iPhone 18 Pro, which shows the variable aperture mechanism up close and explores a potential issue involving display repairs. Watch it below.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-18-pro\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070612\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/20/ifixit-tears-down-iphone-18-pro-explores-variable-aperture-finds-concerning-repair-issue/#more-1070612\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
