        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-watch-series-12.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Well, this is odd. The handwashing timer feature is currently absent from the new Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4 hardware.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-health,apple-watch,apple-watch-series-12,apple-watch-ultra-4\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070608\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/19/apple-watch-series-12-ultra-4-missing-one-health-feature/#more-1070608\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
