        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/apple-releases-xcode-27-1-beta-enabling-iphone-duo-app-development/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/xcode.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has released Xcode 27.1 beta 1 for developers. This version specifically enables app development that targets the new foldable iPhone Duo.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070504\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/apple-releases-xcode-27-1-beta-enabling-iphone-duo-app-development/#more-1070504\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
