        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/apple-intelligence-now-requires-almost-double-the-iphone-storage-on-latest-models/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-intelligence-ai-iphone-18-pro-blue.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 launched this week with a major overhaul to Apple Intelligence. And while many iPhones have the same AI storage requirements as before, for certain models you’ll need nearly double the free storage.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-intelligence,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070445\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/apple-intelligence-now-requires-almost-double-the-iphone-storage-on-latest-models/#more-1070445\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
