        "title": "Here are all of Apple’s official accessories for iPhone 18 Pro, Apple Watch Series 12, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/here-are-all-of-apples-official-accessories-for-iphone-18-pro-apple-watch-series-12-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-cases.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today is Apple launch day for a bunch of new Apple products: iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max, Apple Watch Series 12, Apple Watch Ultra 4, and AirPods 5. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below, we’ve rounded up all of the official Apple accessories for the new 18 Pro/Max, the latest Series 12/Ultra 4, and more. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-watch,iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1069095\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/here-are-all-of-apples-official-accessories-for-iphone-18-pro-apple-watch-series-12-more/#more-1069095\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
