        "title": "WhatsApp starts rolling out new in-chat search button on iOS",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/17/whatsapp-starts-rolling-out-new-in-chat-search-button-on-ios/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/whatsapp-ios27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following a few weeks of beta testing, WhatsApp is now rolling out its new in-chat search button to iPhone users. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"whatsapp\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070422\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/17/whatsapp-starts-rolling-out-new-in-chat-search-button-on-ios/#more-1070422\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
