        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/apple-releases-macos-27-2-golden-gate-public-beta-1/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27.2-public.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After releasing the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/macos-27-2-golden-gate-beta-2-now-available-heres-what-to-expect/\">second developer beta for macOS 27.2 Golden Gate </a>yesterday, Apple is now rolling out the public beta as well. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"macos,macos-27,macos-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070342\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/apple-releases-macos-27-2-golden-gate-public-beta-1/#more-1070342\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
