        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/sisters-grimm.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple TV today unveiled the trailer for the upcoming second season of its animated adventure series “<a href=\"https://apple.co/4At6Fbl\">The Sisters Grimm</a>.” Watch it below.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071102\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/apple-tv-the-sisters-grimm-gets-season-2-trailer-ahead-of-october-premiere/#more-1071102\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
