        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/siri-ai-ui-ios-27-carplay.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 has arrived, and with it a handful of improvements for CarPlay. Here’s everything new for CarPlay in iOS 27.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"carplay,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1055739\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/heres-everything-new-for-carplay-in-ios-27/#more-1055739\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
