        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-wallpapers.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Although Apple did not include the iPhone Duo’s wallpapers in iOS 27, the company did include them in the iPhone simulator in Xcode 27.1 beta, released earlier today, which means now you can download them. Get them below.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-duo,wallpapers\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070535\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/download-the-iphone-duos-official-light-and-dark-wallpapers-here/#more-1070535\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
