        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/zero-to-agent-in-30-minutes-build-a-sports-concierge-agent-with-chester-ismay/",
        "content_text": "Chester Ismay, a data science educator and AI consultant, created schedule viewers to keep up with the sports he follows, including the WNBA, NFL, NBA, and Premier League. But he still had to decide which games deserved his attention each week. In this episode of Zero to Agent in 30 Minutes, Chester built a sports [&#8230;]",
