        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-post-training-process-openai-used-for-chatgpt/",
        "content_text": "This is the third post in a four-part series about post-training. If you missed them, read part 1 and part 2. The final post, on implementing your own pipeline, will be coming October 7. Now that you understand the gist of reinforcement learning and supervised fine-tuning, it’s time to explore what post-training has actually accomplished [&#8230;]",
        "type": "Technology",
